损害整个行业的信任。\n\n “未知钱包”意味着链上监测平台尚未识别该地址的归属，并不意味着资产被盗。这笔 1.72 亿枚 https://t.co/UFIdYhuSil"},{"created_at":"2026-10-30T12:58:28.000Z","edit_history_post_ids":["2116152759494062282"],"id":"2116152759494062282","lang":"en","note_tweet":{"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":239,"start":233,"tag":"ANIME"},{"end":299,"start":294,"tag":"ARPA"},{"end":306,"start":301,"tag":"BARD"},{"end":313,"start":308,"tag":"CELR"},{"end":425,"start":421,"tag":"FTT"},{"end":431,"start":427,"tag":"GLM"},{"end":438,"start":433,"tag":"HIGH"},{"end":444,"start":440,"tag":"HOT"},{"end":450,"start":446,"tag":"KNC"},{"end":457,"start":452,"tag":"LQTY"},{"end":464,"start":459,"tag":"RARE"},{"end":524,"start":519,"tag":"SIGN"},{"end":533,"start":529,"tag":"WOO"}],"mentions":[{"end":54,"id":"877807935493033984","start":46,"username":"binance"}]},"text":"Earlier today, the attacker behind the recent @binance  exploit, apparently in error, sent approximately 8.0M NEWT directly to the NEWT token contract address (0xd0ec028a3d21533fdd200838f39c85b03679285d), along with 17 other tokens: $ANIME, ethereum:0x8290333cef9e6d528dd5618fb97a76f268f3edd4, $ARPA, $BARD, $CELR, ethereum:0x3597bfd533a99c9aa083587b074434e61eb0a258, ethereum:0x0f81001ef0a83ecce5ccebf63eb302c70a39a654, $FTT, $GLM, $HIGH, $HOT, $KNC, $LQTY, $RARE, ethereum:0x259338656198ec7a76c729514d3cb45dfbf768a1, $SIGN and $WOO. These tokens are worth roughly $3.5 million at current prices.\n\nTo be clear, the NEWT token contract itself was not compromised.\n\nWe have reviewed the contract carefully, and unfortunately these tokens cannot be recovered. The NEWT token contract was built to be immutable: it has no owner or admin, all admin rights were renounced onchain in 2025, and upgrades are permanently disabled. That design exists to protect holders, so that no one, including the Foundation, can ever move or alter their tokens. These safeguards mean there is no way for anyone to retrieve tokens sent to the contract itself.\n\nThese tokens are now permanently locked. They are out of the attacker’s control and can never be sold into the market.\n\nWe have shared our findings with Binance and we will keep helping however we can."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":48,"impression_count":138399,"like_count":398,"quote_count":29,"reply_count":50,"repost_count":36},"text":"Earlier today, the attacker behind the recent @binance  exploit, apparently in error, sent approximately 8.0M NEWT directly to the NEWT token contract address (0xd0ec028a3d21533fdd200838f39c85b03679285d), along with 17 other tokens: $ANIME,"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2116261241257664512"]},"created_at":"2026-10-30T20:13:07.000Z","edit_history_post_ids":["2116262141745565826"],"id":"2116262141745565826","lang":"en","note_tweet":{"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/jf/under_the…","end":143,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/jf/under_the_hood","start":120,"url":"https://t.co/Yu6iO3TA1I"}]},"text":"Under the Hood now shows you which posts received a visibility-limiting label, making it easier to see what’s affected: https://t.co/Yu6iO3TA1I\n\nThis was a top request — thanks for the feedback.\n\nYou’ll see the specific posts listed when fewer than 5% of your posts during the report period have that label."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10480,"impression_count":3032161,"like_count":6753,"quote_count":1569,"reply_count":1021,"repost_count":1444},"text":"Under the Hood now shows you which posts received a visibility-limiting label, making it easier to see what’s affected: https://t.co/ro6PP3tdrk\n\nThis was a top request — thanks for the feedback.\n\nYou’ll see the specific posts listed when fewer than 5% of your posts during the https://t.co/VZlMZPB2eY"}]},"meta":{"result_count":44}}
